                                "example_id": "ad290362-9766-4030-b7df-842705c48664",
                                "sense_id": "17401ce2-4330-3ac6-b0fe-616b62aa1fb4",
                                "text": "Hold; while Prometheus is about it, I’ll order a complete man after a desirable pattern. Imprimis, fifty feet high in his socks; then, chest modelled after the Thames Tunnel; then, legs with roots to ’em, to stay in one place; then, arms three feet through the wrist; no heart at all, brass forehead, and about a quarter of an acre of fine brains; and let me see—shall I order eyes to see outwards? No, but put a sky-light on top of his head to illuminate inwards. There, take the order, and away."
                            }
                        ]
